    "Metadata": {
      "Title": "Veridant",
      "Description": "A Mediterranean cliffside resort at sunset after rain: a wet courtyard round its reflecting pool, travertine terraces, a colonnaded cafe and a gallery lounge, and the bay beyond with a superyacht and a hilltop village on the headland.",
